  "image_manifest_sha256": "e1007d557912fd2e719a23b66e76ac98ff20edb28eb8a61d9499ff52116139f0",
  "review_method": "Manual inspection of run #544 inventory and the six normal/SHIFT captures for the changed Exodium, Iridium and Hellspec sprites. The other gameplay scenes were unchanged from the full 76-capture review in run #526. Rehashed all current JPEG review copies and the evidence manifest.",
  "observations": [
    "The current inventory capture shows all three original 32×32 runtime icons loading on the handheld item models; Exodium, Iridium and Hellspec keep distinct gold/cyan, silver/violet and charcoal/ember palettes.",
    "Rechecked normal and SHIFT captures for Exodium Starfall, Iridium Lodebreaker and Hellspec Infernal Bloom. The sprites remain crisp and readable beside the unchanged ability UI.",
    "The remaining gameplay visuals and ten other item textures are unchanged from the complete review in run #526.",
    "All 76 current run JPEG review copies have hashes recorded and are tied to the current evidence-manifest SHA-256."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "The screenshots come from the CI client harness. The ghouls instance, its full mod set, shaders, and performance were not tested.",
    "This approval covers rendered visual evidence, not multiplayer balance or every third-party block interaction."
  ],
  "review_notes": "Run #544: inspected the current inventory crop and the normal/SHIFT scenes for Exodium, Iridium and Hellspec after replacing their runtime icons. All three redraws render cleanly with the handheld model and remain distinct at inventory size. The remaining ability visuals are unchanged from the prior complete review."
}
